Does the same happen just using debug within R, not Revolution R?

This comes most likely from the fact that embedd is not exported to the user workspace, maybe doing simply
library(tseriesChaos)
or:
embedd <- tseriesChaos:::embedd

would solve the problem, although it is a local fix, not a global solution!

